        <mxCell id="c17" value="after new-seat COMMIT only" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=white;strokeColor=white;fontColor=#172b42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="955" y="555" width="470" height="60" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c18" value="reserve(...) result contract&#10;New { reservation: Reservation, email: Requested | Unavailable } - newly committed seat; one confirmation attempt.&#10;Existing { reservation: Reservation, email: NotRequested } - the exact saved record; no update, insert or email.&#10;Rejected { reason: Unauthenticated | WorkshopNotFound | NotPublished | Full } - no reservation change or email.&#10;StorageFailure - persistence/commit could not be confirmed; do not claim success or request email; refresh reads authoritative state.&#10;WorkshopId / StudentId / ReservationId are distinct string types; Timestamp is an instant; Email is an email address." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff2dd;strokeColor=#506176;fontColor=#172b42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=22;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="970" width="1970" height="220" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c19" value="ORDERED RESERVATION ALGORITHM&#10;1. Reject Unauthenticated before any reservation lookup or mutation.&#10;2. Workshop Store begins a READ COMMITTED transaction.&#10;3. SELECT workshop WHERE id = wid FOR UPDATE; missing -&gt; reject.&#10;4. In a separate statement, find this student's existing reservation.&#10;   If found, return that record unchanged (even when full).&#10;5. For a new seat, require published; count seats in a later statement.&#10;   If count &gt;= capacity, reject Full without writes.&#10;6. Insert one new reservation with the verified student ID/name/email.&#10;   COMMIT before returning Created from Workshop Store.&#10;7. Only Created triggers Confirmation.requestOnce; return New.&#10;   Catch unavailable/timeout -&gt; New(email=Unavailable); retain seat." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e8f1fc;strokeColor=#506176;fontColor=#172b42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="60" y="1240" width="1190" height="440" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c20" value="INVARIANT AND OVERLAP PROOF [R4, R5]&#10;For each workshop: 0 &lt;= count &lt;= capacity;&#10;for each (workshopId, studentId): count &lt;= 1.&#10;All reservation writers lock the same workshop row&#10;until commit; no direct write path bypasses Store.&#10;A waiting caller reads existing/count after acquiring&#10;the lock, using new READ COMMITTED statements.&#10;Thus it sees prior commits before deciding to insert.&#10;UNIQUE(workshopId, studentId) backs up uniqueness;&#10;Workshop.id primary key; foreign key from each seat.&#10;Capacity CHECK (1..20); fixed after creation.&#10;Mail failure cannot undo an already committed seat." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#e4f4ed;strokeColor=#506176;fontColor=#172b42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=23;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1300" y="1240" width="730" height="440" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c21" value="Legend: blue = code elements inside Reservation Rules; grey = supporting component interfaces outside that parent; green/orange = explanation.&#10;Dashed outline = expanded component; arrows = calls or type dependencies. Promise&lt;T&gt; = asynchronous result; Tx = transaction-scoped interface." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f0f2f5;strokeColor=#506176;fontColor=#172b42;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry as="geometry" x="35" y="1745" width="2030" height="90" />
        </mxCell>
